  message: "Closed by PR #3894 (6c076eb019). Root cause was framework detector matching only literal 'requirements.txt' and ignoring -r/-c includes. Fix adds _collect_pip_requirements_deps with seeded discovery (requirements.txt recursive + requirements/*.txt + requirements-*.txt) + worklist that follows -r/--requirement/-c/--constraint references (with = form variants); bounded by repo_root with directory-traversal guards. Six new tests pin the invariant. Verification target met: WI-jifib AC-2 Wagtail Page rescue measurement on bakerydemo-shaped repos is now unblocked."  # aa21
